Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:03.07,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Oh, what a day
Comment: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.29,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Are you here? Can you hear me?
Comment: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:09.23,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,This triller isn’t over
Comment: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:12.56,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I see her smile when I close my eyes
Comment: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:19.42,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I guess I’ll sleep, so that I can see her in my dreams
Comment: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:22.74,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Where we’ll live again
Comment: 0,0:00:31.59,0:00:34.76,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Everything I see and everywhere I’ve been
Comment: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:37.35,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Reflect the days we used to have
Comment: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.87,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,And even though they are now a blur
Comment: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:42.69,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I really don’t regret what I did for her
Comment: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:45.74,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I was all alone. Then felt at home
Comment: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:48.46,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,When you were standing right here beside me
Comment: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.44,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,But suddenly it ended
Comment: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:51.47,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I’m not offended
Comment: 0,0:00:51.47,0:00:53.67,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gone with a sound of a ringing bell
Comment: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:59.04,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I guess I’m alone now, I’m on my own
Comment: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.16,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,As funny as it sounds
Comment: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:05.03,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,What goes around comes around again
Comment: 0,0:01:05.03,0:01:07.63,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I don’t blame your lies
Comment: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:10.31,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,And I hope we can remember
Comment: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:13.91,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,All the days that we both smiled
Comment: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:15.89,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,They were real with you
Comment: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:21.27,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I know I’m not the type to take your time and waste it
Comment: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:24.88,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,I just want you to smile
Comment: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:30.05,ED-EN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You know that I’d never let you in
Comment: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:03.07,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,噫！何其良辰美景也
Comment: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.29,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,爾在此乎？可聞余言？
Comment: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:09.23,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,斯劇未完 當續前行
Comment: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:12.56,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,吾閉目 見其笑顏
Comment: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:19.42,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,我當憩息 以夢中再逢
Comment: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:22.74,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,茲地再次共生
Comment: 0,0:00:31.59,0:00:34.76,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,余之所見 余之所至
Comment: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:37.35,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,皆昔日之光景
Comment: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.87,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,即使今日亦已模糊
Comment: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:42.69,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,然余實不悔 曾因彼而付出之一切
Comment: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:45.74,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,昔時孑然一身
Comment: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:48.46,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,而今 爾側吾心如歸
Comment: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.44,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,終之以速也
Comment: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:51.47,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,吾不以為憾
Comment: 0,0:00:51.47,0:00:53.67,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯聞鐘聲響起 漸行漸遠
Comment: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:59.04,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,茲吾孑然一身 獨立於此
Comment: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.16,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,是則尤為有趣
Comment: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:05.03,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,時過境遷 草木更迭
Comment: 0,0:01:05.03,0:01:07.63,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,吾不咎於汝之謊言
Comment: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:10.31,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,亦期汝能銘記
Comment: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:13.91,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,共度歡笑之時
Comment: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:15.89,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,汝與余 共襄盛舉 皆是真實
Comment: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:21.27,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,吾知不願虛度汝時光
Comment: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:24.88,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯願汝笑顏常在
Comment: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:30.05,ED-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,爾深知余將爾之弗棄
Comment: 0,0:21:37.99,0:21:38.03,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,=======ED=======
